name lumbras-gigabase
# LumbrasGigaBase (lumbrasgigabase.com): games played online and over the board, one PGN file a period, opened from the
# 7z archives beside them into online/ and otb/ (Laplace-Operations data.tsv). pgn/export_ELO2400.pgn is the
# OTB_ELITE_ELO2400 selection, games otb/ holds already, and is not read. A corpus witnessing its records, as
# chess-com's archive is.
witness LumbrasGigaBase
class StructuredCorpus
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/Lumbras
files $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/Lumbras/online/*.pgn
files $LAPLACE_DATA/Games/Chess/Lumbras/otb/*.pgn
after unicode
